160%\">. 직접 신고시 제출서류 : </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">예비군대원신고서 1부(첨부양식 Download 받아 작성)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0033ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;마.&nbsp;장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0033ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">학교예비군연대본부(글로벌관 110호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0033ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">※참고사항</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> : 대학직장예비군에 편성된 학생은 학업에 지장이&nbsp;없도록 예비군</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">으로서의 의무를 최소화하여 8시간만&nbsp;훈련을 받도록 혜택이 부여&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">됩니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;※상기 신고기간 내 신고하지 않아 발생되는 제반사항에 대해서는 학생 본인이&nbsp;책임져야 합니다(직업보호대상에서 제외)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;※문의전화 : (054)478~7159, 7158(연대행정실)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">금오공과대학교직장예비군연대</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
